        <body>
            <div xml:id="d148-a1">

                <pb facs="0315" n="219" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg219"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 54.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Translation of an imperial decree published in the
                        Peking Gazette, September 25, 1898.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Ever since the fourth moon we have constantly been indisposed, and although for a
                    long time have been under treatment there has been no improvement. Therefore if
                    there is any person who is skilled in the science of medicine, let him be
                    recommended immediately by any official in the Empire, and if he is now residing
                    in some other province, let him come to Peking speedily and without delay.</p>
            </div>
